\set ECHO none
--- part 1: a regular foreign key cannot reference a predicated key
NO ACTION | 0A000: unique key "unit_active_code" is a predicated key; a regular foreign key can only reference a primary or natural key
CASCADE | 0A000: unique key "unit_active_code" is a predicated key; a regular foreign key can only reference a primary or natural key
catalogued foreign keys | 0
triggers on note and unit | 0
--- part 2: add_foreign_key by columns finds no primary or natural key on code
by columns | P0001: No primary or natural unique key found on table rpk.unit for columns {code}
